  <h2>GENERAL INFORMATION:</h2>
  <p>The University's SBDC is soliciting Request for Quotations from qualified, interested bidders, for the items listed within this RFQ document. This RFQ MUST be signed by an authorized company representative and returned along with the quotation, to indicate acceptance of all terms and conditions of this RFQ.</p>

