  <h2>REQUIRED INFORMATION FROM BIDDERS:</h2>
  <p>In no more than ten (20) pages, all bidders MUST provide a written response to address how your firm would provide all elements listed within the Scope of Work also, all bidders MUST be in compliance with FAU's additional terms and conditions, which are available using the following link: <a href="https://www.fau.edu/controller/purchasing/files/poterms.pdf">https://www.fau.edu/controller/purchasing/files/poterms.pdf</a>. Furthermore, the following additional requirements MUST be included:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>An executive summary of the firm</li>
    <li>Demonstrate at least three (3) years of experience on providing the same or similar services. Please provide a list of minimum three (3) client references;</li>
